OL,5,G1000 Train Truckers
OL,6,     F100 Ton Train: A fully restored
OL,7,     FClass 47 diesel engine is
OL,8,     Ftransported from its home at Crewe
OL,9,     FHeritage Centre in Cheshire to the
OL,10,     FEcclesbourne Valley Railway in
OL,11,     FDerbyshire.
OL,12,G1100 Train Truckers
OL,13,     FHeavy Haul Train: A CBD80
OL,14,     Fbattery-powered loco needs to be
OL,15,     Fhauled 20 miles from a factory in
OL,16,     FBurton-on-Trent to the heritage
OL,17,     FChasewater Railway in
OL,18,     FStaffordshire.
